[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m# 3. Delivered Artifacts[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe sprint successfully produced:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* Engineering Change Governance Policy[m
[32m+[m[32m* Execution Contract infrastructure[m
[32m+[m[32m* Standardized planning template[m
